Done. The CI failure was in `hooks/useReceiptSplit.ts` — `confirmError` and `setConfirmError` were referenced in the return object but never declared. Fixed by:

1. Adding `const [confirmError, setConfirmError] = useState<string | null>(null);`
2. Updating `confirmItems` to use `setConfirmError` (instead of the unrelated `setSaveError`)
3. Adding `setConfirmError(null)` to `reset()`
